{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this app, you take control of 3D simulation space where each cell lives and dies based on the rules you set for them. There are practically countless different starting conditions and rules you can use to see what kind of behaviors they produce.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own seed for simulation starting condition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set birth, survive and death conditions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your simulations and return to them later</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step backwards to previous simulation states</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different visual simulation geometries (cube, galaxy, field &amp; loose)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >User controls for the simulation</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visuals including individual cell appearance and colors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overall UI theme and colors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulation speed and dimensions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animations (cell size &amp; birth + death visuals)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Audio and music</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Start your journey of discovery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world where patterns grow, collide and evolve in ways you have never seen before. Build your own mesmerizing 3D lifeforms and complex structures or see what can emerge from pure chaos. Have fun exploring Game of Life 3D and it's endless possibilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3637350?t=1772363309","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3637350?t=1772363309","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637350/44943d2b22a6bb5d483f12c73959